flowchart TD
    A[User describes a game glitch] --> B[Input Validator]

    B -->|Invalid input| C[Safe Error Message]
    B -->|Valid input| D[Glitch Classifier]

    D --> E[Knowledge Base Retriever]
    E --> F[Rank Matching Troubleshooting Records]

    F --> G[Confidence Calculator]
    G --> H[Diagnosis Generator]

    H --> I{Confidence high enough?}

    I -->|Yes| J[Return Possible Causes and Troubleshooting Steps]
    I -->|No| K[Request More Details and Show Limited Guidance]

    C --> L[System Logger]
    J --> L
    K --> L

    L --> M[Evaluation Results]
    M --> N[Human Review]